  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Smt Saraswathi N L vs State Of Karnataka on 2 July, 2024 Author: M.Nagaprasanna Bench: M.Nagaprasanna -1- NC: 2024:KHC:24960 WP No. 13224 of 2023 IN THE HIGH COURT OF KARNATAKA AT BENGALURU DATED THIS THE 2ND DAY OF JULY, 2024 BEFORE THE HON'BLE MR JUSTICE M.NAGAPRASANNA WRIT PETITION NO. 13224 OF 2023 (GM-RES) BETWEEN: SMT SARASWATHI N L W/O SHIVAMURTHY AGED ABOUT 46 YEARS ASSISTANT DIRECTOR KSHARA DASHOHA TIPATUR TALUK TIPTUR - 572 201 TUMKUR DIST KARNATAKA STATE ...PETITIONER (BY SRI. D BASAVARAJAPPA, ADVOCATE) AND: 1. STATE OF KARNATAKA Digitally signed REP. BY ITS SECRETARY by NAGAVENI DEPARTMENT OF FOOD AND CIVIL SUPPLY Location: HIGH COURT OF VIDHANA SOUDHA, AMBEDKAR ROAD KARNATAKA BANGALORE - 560 001 KARNATAKA STATE 2. SHRI DR. N S RAVIKUMAR FOOD SAFETY OFFICER Smt Saraswathi N L vs State Of Karnataka on 2 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/69860217/ 1 OFFICE OF TALUK HEALTH OFFICER TIPATUR TALUK, TIPATUR - 572 201 TUMKUR DISTRICT KARNATAKA STATE ...RESPONDENTS (BY SRI. HARISH GANAPATHI, HCGP FOR R1) -2- NC: 2024:KHC:24960 WP No. 13224 of 2023 THIS WP IS FILED UNDER ARTICLES 226 AND 227 OF THE CONSTITUTION OF INDIA READ WITH SECTION 482 OF CR.P.C., RAYING TO DIRECT FOR QUASHING THE CHARGE SHEET DTD 29/10/2020 AS PER ANNEXURE-B SUBMITTED BY THE R-2 BEFORE THE COURT OF CIVIL JUDGE (SR DI) AND J.M.F.C TIPTOOR IN C.C.440/2020 AND ETC. THIS PETITION, COMING ON FOR ORDERS, THIS DAY, THE COURT MADE THE FOLLOWING: ORDER Learned counsel appearing for the petitioner files a memo seeking to withdraw the petition.",
